    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n73527" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀμμᾰτ-όω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>furnish with eyes,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ἀγάλματα]</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.S.
					4.76
				</span></i>
			 :—
				Pass.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ σῶμα πρόσω ὠμμάτωται</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
				</span></i>
			<i>Fr.inc.</i><i><span class="en">
				91
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>give sight to,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ ὄμματα</span>”
