					Zos.
				</span></i>
			 Alch.<i><span class="en">
				p.117
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				B.
			</span></i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> metaph., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὠμμάτωσα γὰρ σαφέστερον [τὸν λόγον]</span>
