				467
			</span></i> :—
				Pass.
			, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φρὴν ὠμματωμένη</span> a
			mind <i>quick of sight,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Ch.</u>
				854
			</span></i>.</div>
